message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below, together with the original experiment and its data listed in references."
title: "Classical estimate of the two-step 6x6 Hubbard pairing circuit (Quantum Advantage Tracker issue 259)"
abstract: >-
  Classical evaluation of the staggered pairing statistic after the two-step
  light pulse of the 6x6 Hubbard (U/t = 8, half filling) pairing circuit, by
  back-propagation of the observable and a connected-cumulant expansion of the
  prepared state over supports of up to six sites. Includes exact small-lattice
  simulators, the stored results and a conditional error estimate.
